OL,3,ATwo killed in 'massive' Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Aattack on Moscow region, says Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two people have been killed
OL,7,Fand six injured in a "massive"
OL,8,Fovernight Ukrainian drone attack on the
OL,9,FMoscow region, Governor Andrei Vorobyev
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FVorobyev said 249 drones had been shot
OL,13,Fdown, and he reported fires in several
OL,14,Fresidential houses. A local warehouse
OL,15,Fwas also ablaze. In the capital Moscow,
OL,16,Fan oil refinery was damaged, and flight
OL,17,Frestrictions were in place at two
OL,18,Fairports.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
